						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#709">Meeting Next Weekend</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							As you all know I have chosen to reform this guild with another name.  The name The Ancients has history before me.  History that I know nothing of.  Members I don't know as well, and as of last week, I found out that it too has officers I don't know of.  So I have elected to create a new guild.  One that has no unknown history.  <br />
<br />
If you chose to follow me, then you will need to be in the tunnel in EC one of the three meetings that I will be having.  I will have dates and times with my next guild news and they will be posted on the MOTD, I just don't know myself right now when I want them to be.<br />
<br />
I want no one left behind.  However, someone will miss this, and not see the MOTD.  And it is for that I will be handing The Ancients over to one of my Officers Alts.  That officer will see to it that he has a list of all the new officers on the new guild and will be spending all of his game time transfering members.  You may ask yourself why come to the meetings if an officer will be working on the ones left behind.  Well my friends it is simple.  It is up to you, but I can tell you this loyalty matters to me, and if you fail to show up for the beginning of our adventure, I may question just how loyal you are to me.<br />
<br />
I have gotten alot of sugestions on what to name the new guild.  All of the sugestions that I have recieved are good one, so I am met with  a problem.  I want you all to post your ideas on the message board.  I have started a post called New Name.  All I want you to do is put the idea that you have on thier, and if you like someone elses idea you may say it there as well.  I will check them all and I will choose.<br />
<br />
I thought about making a vote on it, but no I am not going to do that.  It has been brought to my attention that I have not ruled this guild with enough authority, and that too will changes.  Whenever I am about to speak to the guild an officer will anounce it.  I will not speak canditly anymore.  I am your leader, and I can't be newest budy.  For that I am sorry, but it is the way that it has to be. <br />
<br />
Some may want to leave because of my words, and that is fime don't show up to one of the meetings then.  And don't let my officer know that you where left behind.  Just quit us.<br />
<br />
Thanks for you time guys,<br />
<br />
Ciervox Mystieria
