						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#678">Membership/Officer Requirements</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Membership Requirements<br />
<br />
Each new invitation is to be sponsored by two long-standing members..<br />
Those two sponsors are to be the new invitee’s point of contact, for answering guild-related questions and explaining the rules. <br />
All new invitations are subject to a thirty-day probationary period, at which time it becomes permanent. <br />
All new members to are required to register their character with the guild website, read the listing of rules on the Message Board and post a reply that they’ve read and will comply all within that 30-day period. Probationary members may not sponsor new entries.<br />
<br />
Officer requirements:<br />
<br />
Minimum level: 25<br />
Minimum length of membership: 90 days, including the 30-day probationary time<br />
<br />
Must to have participated in, at least two raids either within or outside the guild<br />
Must to have planned and lead a raid or raid-like activity.<br />
Must be sponsored by at least four long-standing members.<br />
Must have the Planes of Power expansion prior to promotion<br />
Announced candidate will be promoted on a provisional 30 day basis, subject to review and approval by current officer staff.<br />
<br />
The Guild Leader is exempt from the above restrictions and retains sole discretionary powers of invitation and promotion within the guild.<br />
<br />
Ollie
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							<br>
														<strong>By:</strong>
							<span class="name"> <a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=4391">Phreda Bloodblades</a> at 2:28 AM PST - December 9th, 2002</span>
						</td>
					</tr>
